Grammar

    0 $accept: program $end

    1 program: program term
    2        | term

    3 term: OP
    4     | NEQ
    5     | LEQ
    6     | AND
    7     | PRECOMPILER
    8     | NUMCONST
    9     | ELSE
   10     | UNTIL
   11     | ASSIGN
   12     | REPEAT
   13     | THEN
   14     | IF
   15     | CHARCONST
   16     | WHILE
   17     | ID
   18     | CHAR
   19     | DEC
   20     | MIN
   21     | MAX
   22     | BOOL
   23     | STRINGCONST
   24     | BY
   25     | BREAK
   26     | FALSE
   27     | FOR
   28     | INT
   29     | NOT
   30     | MULASS
   31     | INC
   32     | ADDASS
   33     | EQ
   34     | GEQ
   35     | SUBASS
   36     | DIVASS
   37     | OR
   38     | RETURN
   39     | DO
   40     | STATIC
   41     | TO
   42     | TRUE


